          "ocr_text": "April 27\nS- Not when much time had been spent and sailing was now dangerous\nbecause the Fast was already over, Paul advised them. Acts 27:9\n\nO- The Fast is the day of atonement in Sept. And sailing after\nthen is risky. Paul was a very curse guy. Even as a prisoner,\nwell travelled and ship wrecked 3 times. But continued\nhe had a mission to accomplish.\n\nA- Passover, Pentecost and Atonement are all days spoken of in\nscripture and I should be attentive these days\nas they are significant.\n\nP- God help me to be looking forward to your return\nand to recognize it and to do what you have called\nme to do.\n\nApril 28\nS- Then Paul dwelt two whole years in his own rented house and\nreceived all who came to him preaching the kingdom of God\nand teaching the things which concern the Lord Jesus Christ\nwith all confidence no one forbidding him. Acts 28: 30, 31\n\nO- Paul preached the kingdom of God. The kingdom of God is\nnot just forgiveness \u0026 sins and going to heaven after you\ndie but Jesus coming back to rule and reign on Earth\nwith those who follow Him.\n\nA- I need to Preach the Kingdom of Heaven and the kingdom\nof God.\n\nP- God help me to keep my eyes on the coming kingdom\nApril 29\nS- And this is the will of Him who sent me, that everyone who sees\nthe Son and believes in Him may have everlasting life and\nI will raise him up at the last day, John6: 40\n\nO- Jesus says that raising us up on the last day is the\nwill of the Father.\n\nA- I believe in Jesus and believe in everlasting life and\nbeing raised on the last day.\n\nP- God thank you for sending your son to grant us\neternal life and raising us up in the same way that\nyou were raised to life.",
