          "ocr_text": "April 20\nS- No one can come to me unless the Father who sent me\ndraws Him and I will raise Him up on the last day. John\n6:44\n\nO- The only way we can come to Jesus is if God\nthe Father draws Him. And Jesus will raise him\nup on the last day.\n\nA- I will be grateful for being drawn to Jesus.\nGod has chosen me and adopted me into\nHis family. I will up the kingdom of God\nwell through His grace.\n\nP- God please help me to be a good steward\nof your grace.\n\nMay 1\nS- This is the will of the Father who sent me that of all He\nhas given Me I should lose nothing, but should raise it\nup at the last day. John 6:39\n\nO- The Father gives to the Son. And the son keep what is\ngiven to Him and will raise it up on the last day\n\nA- I need to have faith that my resurrecting is the\nwill of the Father and entrusted to the Son.\n2x 1:44 The Father gives/chooses.\n\nP- God thank you that you have drawn me and given me\nto Jesus and He will not loss me.\n\nMay 2\nS- Whoever eats my flesh and drinks my blood has eternal\nlife and I will raise him up on the last day. John 6:54\n\nO- Of it that Jesus says He will raise us up on the last\nday by is the Father give a Jesus keeps. Father gives,\nwe see we believe, we eat and drink his body \u0026 blood, He\nraises on the last day.\n\nA- My hope is a kingdom of God on earth. Inhabited\nby citizens incorruptible in love with Jesus and his\nbride.\n\nP- God help me to be faithful and to multiply what\nyou have given to me.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
