          "journal_date": "2026-04-13",
          "ocr_text": "April 13 - History Our and Future - Gospel Gwen Eogt to west\nFuture - All fact s will stand on this now\nMandate: Make Disciples\nPower \u0026 HS empowered to be witnesses\n- Testimony\n- Answered Prayer\n- Divine Appointments\n- Gospel \u0026 Kingdom\n- Marketplace Ministry - Prayer Evangelism\n- Pauls Pattern\n\n5- As they ministered to the Lord and fasted the Holy Spirit said\n\"Now Separate to Me Barnabas and Saul for the work which\nI have called them.\" Then tabasing fasted and prayed and\nlaid hands on them, they sent them away. Acts 13:2,3\n\nO- the Holy Spirit gave the direction and asked them to\nsend these two men to Himself. They were sent\nFrom the church into the hands of the Holy Spirit.\nThe church didn't control the ones sent. The\ndidn't know the assignment of the sent. Nor did\nthe sent know. They just went.\n\nA- The more we empower the less power we will have.\nThe Holy Spirit will ask separate people for\nHis purpose and we will not control or dictate\nthe mission of\n\nP- God help me to be submitted to your spirit and to give\nall power and honor to you. Help all authority to\nbe submitted to.\n\nApril 14,\nS- And with these sayings they could scarce restrain the multitudes\nfrom sacrificing as them. Then Jews from Antioch and Iconium\ncame there and having persuaded the multitudes they stoned\nPaul and dragged him out of the city supposing him to be\ndead. Acts 14:18,19\n\nO- The people went from believing their eyes to believing accusations\nof strangers. They went from worship to warfare in one verse.\nThe extent of their worship can also be their hatred.\n\nA- I should not live for the praises of man as it is\nvery fickle.\n\nP- God help me to live for what you see and think and no\none else.",
