          "ocr_text": "March 10 - Evan said that the help spirit leaders ever are saying he shares and is God ways that things make us. We led I send up ICs days is what I began from the help Jesus is to gospel of the grace of God. Acts 20:27\n\nO - Suffering is a powerful testimony. Kingdom of God suffers violence. I Vincent take it by force. My God is greater than your reign. My God is greater than your kingdom. I'm self love children. Habakkuk has said.\n\nA - The persecuted church was and perfect + Jesus. The church at Philadelphia was made perfect by Jesus must praise the love of god. Let God loved others through my life to make disciples.\n\nP - God please help me to know your love And to love others to be able to be moved with your compassion. Not obligation or selfish ambition but with your love for the lost.\n\nMarch 11\nS - Crying out \"Man of God give help! This the man who heads all men everywhere against the people, the law and this place and further more he also brought Greeks into the temple and has defiled this holy place. Acts 21: 28.\n\nO - Jews felt threatened. Paul was teaching against Jewish custom, the law and the synagogue. And filling the temple with unclean people. This was true as the New covenant do of grace did do this but it was God's plan. Not to pour new wine into old wine skins. God wanted both preserved. But man has a difficult time switching direction.\n\nA - Jesus needed to die to show his love and to show a better way. He invites us to die with Him to show others a better way to live together.\n\nP - God help me to understand your ways and to love others into your ways, through dying to myself.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
