          "ocr_text": "Success doesn't happen overnight - Everyday\nDevotions = Seeing God.\nWe are not FIXED\nWe are not HEALED\nWe need to see our SIN in the light of God's LOVE.\nHonestly before God is walking in the Light.\nCompassionately Curious -\nThree things why our devotions don't change us.\n1. Checklist mentality vs Light Switch turning on.\n2. Compartmentalism vs Wholeness - Live in integrity,\n   Bring ALL things into my devotions\n3. Performance - vs Transparency - Impact with weakness\n\nFeb 23\nS- For a harlot is a deep pit and a seductress is a narrow well.\nShe also lies in wait as for a victim and increased the unfaithful\namong men. Prov 23:28\n\nO- This harlot is a spirit. But she isn't even something outside\nof me. Now with AT all the evil in my heart can be created\nas an image of good and bad.\n\nA- AT is only a revealer of the evil inside of me. I must\ngo to someone else to purge my heart of evil.\n\nP- God please purge my heart of all evil. Help me to\nknow how to get rid of all distractions.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1781663719504.jpg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1781663719504.jpg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": "Proverbs 23:27-28",
