          "journal_date": "2026-01-20",
          "ocr_text": "Jan 29 Round table:\n1. Stay on the escalator - Don't run on it - Dover\n2. Go where the game is.\n3. Pay attention to what we love, kids love what we love. Tithing - need\n4 - Serving - Families together again. Words? Spirit\n5. Billy - Vision - Heads clear clearly.\n   Keep vision in front of our people. Disciples p. sets\n6 - Love Motivation -\n7. Tim - Flyer? Principles for Babala.\n   Have Disciples, Small groups.\n   Kids being Baptized?\n   Reach kids, Reach families kids\n8. Ver- Clarity is bearing fruit - Results that are visible, bring momentum. How?\n   Identity, Values, Discipleship (Family Discipleship)\n   • Federal/Centrality views/values\n\nLLM Notebook\n\n2026 - Pulling same direction\nVersion: Prayed 2 carried in prayer\n9-Give people chance, Discipled 30 Disciplemakers. Wide\n10. Kanik - Adventure Prayed (Sago Last brain)\n   • Pasty - Breaking follows ground\n   • 2026 - Step our to go mistakes\n11. Kakie - New levels - New devils - New prayer\n12. Taris - Late married, late child, late plant. Faithful in others' self\n13. Nokni - Tried test Family.\n14 - Jame, Paunda, Tonga - Transition well = with the right people\n   - New level new devil way. Does happen on a 2-yr.\n   Not about the money, deep = old e. Right people\n   Don't always look\n\nNorman: 2025 - God is miracle, clouds\n- Hard thing is good (God thing\n\nJan 20\n5. Be anxious in nothing! But in everything by prayer and supplication\nwith thanksgiving let your request be made known to God. And\nthe peace of God, that passes understanding will guard your\nheart and mind, in Christ Jesus. Phil 4:6,7\n\n6 - Always ask in a spirit of thanksgiving. God gave us\n   Jesus. Will He not with him lovely give us all things\n\nA - I will not be anxious or worried. I will be thankful\n   and put my trust in God for all my needs\n\nP - God help me to be faithful and obedient to youth\n   every area of my life.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1781663911034.jpg",
