          "journal_date": "2026-06-17",
          "ocr_text": "```json\n{\n  \"ocr_text\": \"June 16\\nS- For it is evident that our Lord arose from Judah, \u0026 thrice the tribe Moses spoke nothing concerning priesthood. And yet far more evident it in the likeness of Melchizedek there law of a flesh. I cannot meet but according to the power of an endless priest forever according to the order of Melchizedek. Heb 5, 19-17\\n\\nO- Jesus is the high priest of a different tribe. Came from Judah. Psalm 110 shares what Jesus will do to kings of the earth. Not a priest of the law, but an everlasting priest of endless life. In the lineage of kings. Conquerors.\\n\\nA- A new testament has begun with Jesus as the high priest. We are all kings and priest to our God. Jesus was a priest on earth, but a king now. I shall follow Jesus as a part of a kingdom of priests.\\n\\nP- God give me eyes to see what you have called the church and your people to. Help me to serve your people and call them to Royalty\",\n  \"scripture_reference\": \"Hebrews 5:19-17, Psalm 110\"\n}\n```",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
