          "import_batch_id": null,
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2026-06-16",
          "ocr_text": "```json\n{\n  \"ocr_text\": \"June 16\\nS- For it is evident that our Lord arose from Judah, of which tribe Moses spoke nothing concerning priesthood. And yet far more evident if in the likeness a priest has arisen there arises another priest who has come according to the law of God's commandment but according to the power of an endless life. \\\"He testifies 'You are a priest forever according to the order of Melchizedek.' Heb 7:19-17\\n\\nO- Jesus is the high priest of a different tribe. Comes from Judah. When 110 shares what Jesus will do. Kings of the earth. Not a priest of the law, but an everlasting priest of endless life. In the lineage of kings. Conqueror.\\n\\nA- A new testament has begun with Jesus as the high priest. We are all kings and priests to our God. Jesus was a priest on earth, but a king now. I shall follow Jesus as a part of a kingdom of priests.\\n\\nP- God give me eyes to see what you have called the church and your people to. Help me to serve your people and call them to Royalty.\",\n  \"scripture_reference\": \"Hebrews 7:15-17\"\n}\n```",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
