          "ocr_text": "God please help me to have your heart of compassion not just for others but myself.\n\nJuly 2\nS- The hardworking farmer must be first to partake of the crops. 2 Tim 2:6\n\nO- He seems to be talking about the 4 generations of ministers of the word in earlier scripture.\n\nA- I think there is something here about compassion to these who make disciples. How does this fit in the model of the church?\n\nP- God please give me wisdom to see what you are doing in my life and how to raise leaders up.",
