          "ocr_text": "```json\n{\n  \"ocr_text\": \"June 10\\nS- God spoke at various times and in various ways spoke in times past to the fathers and the prophets has His these last days of All speaker to us His son whom He had appointed heir of His power of His majesty and the express image of His person and upholding all things by the word of His majesty He sat down at the right hand of His majesty on high having become so much better than the angels as He has by inheritance obtained a more excellent name than they. Hebrews 1:1-4\\n\\nO- We are so blessed that we can hear God through the Holy spirit leading us to Jesus. And Jesus deceased about all things that places him above all things but is offered to us His body \u0026 bride\\n\\nA- I will meditate on my spiritual inheritance more and not get distracted with the insignificant things of the world that will perish.\\n\\nP- God thank you for giving us an inheritance in your son Jesus. Help me to understand and to treasure what you have offered me through Jesus.\\n\\nJune 11\\nS- For it was fitting for him for whom are all things and by whom are all things in bringing many sons to glory to make the captain of their salvation perfect through sufferings. Heb 2:10-11\\n\\nO- Many sons will be brought to glory through suffering. Suffering is the path to glory. God wants to make a King. He will give him a goliath.\\n\\nA- I must welcome suffering in my life to accept the invitation to glory.\\n\\nP- God thank you for the path that leads offering. Let me be a living sacrifice that is holy to you.\",\n  \"scripture_reference\": \"Hebrews 1:1-4, Hebrews 2:10-11\"\n}\n```",
