          "journal_date": "2026-06-25",
          "ocr_text": "be sensitive to your promptings of my heart.\n\nJune 24\nS- As a dog returns to its vomit so a fool returns to\nits folly Prov. 26:11\n\nO- A dog throws up something cause its body is rejecting it\nas something harmful but then will lick it back\nup. A fool will do the same thing. But God gave\nus ability to choose and not need to return\nto behavior that is destructive to ourselves and\nto others.\n\nA- The thing separating us from animals is that we\nwere made in His image like a glove is the\nimage of a hand, it is nothing unless the\nhand is in it. So we are useless if we don't\nhave the spirit of God in us. He will put\nHis laws in our hearts so like a glove can do\nthe work of the hand, I can do the work of God\n\nP- God help me to depend on your spirit to live in\nme and work through me. Help my desires to be\nYours so I wont be like a dog returning to your",
