          "import_batch_id": null,
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2026-06-09",
          "ocr_text": "```json\n{\n  \"ocr_text\": \"June 8\\nS-That Christ may dwell in your hearts through faith; that you being rooted and grounded in (love) may be able to comprehend with all the saints what is the width and length and depth and height and to know the love of Christ which passeth knowledge that you may be filled with the knowledge of God. Eph 3:17-19\\nFULLNESS\\n\\nO- Paul wants the church to understand the love of God to be filled with the FULLNESS of God. I wants do everything to know and to fall in LOVE with Christ.\\n\\nA- I want to pursue Christ. Thankful that He pursued me. Into my walk. Into my addictions. Into my pain. He sat with me. He sits with me. And still calls me to make disciples. To feed his sheep. From a fisher of man to a shepherd. Peter went from pride and performance to Humility and love centered service, surrender. I want to make disciples to be with Jesus.\\n\\nP- God please be with me this week as I ENGAGE, ESTABLISH EQUIP and EMPOWER those in my life to make Disciples.\\n\\nJune 9\\nS- New to Him who is able to do exceedingly abundantly above all that we ask or think according to the power that works in us to Him be glory in the church by Christ Jesus to all generations forever and ever Amen. Eph 3: 20,21\\n\\nO- Amazingly Paul saw the church becoming the glory of Jesus on earth. 2000 yrs later, 2,000,000,000 people around the planet confess faith in Christ from every nation tribe and tongue. For Paul to see this 2000 yrs ago is nothing less than a revelation from God Himself. In that what the saw materialized to what we see today. If this, that we are experiencing is correct, so is the future of resurrection of the saints. To Him be glory in the church.\\n\\nA- I will give my life to beautify the bride that He purchased with His blood.\\n\\nP- Jesus purify my soul and my heart, lead me not into temptation. Deliver me from evil.\",\n  \"scripture_reference\": \"Ephesians 3:17-19, Ephesians 3:20-21\"\n}\n```",
