          "journal_date": "2026-06-24",
          "ocr_text": "A- I will meet with as many to disciple as possible to encourage myself in my faith.\n\nP- God give me grace to repent, be baptized and to walk in the Spirit.\n\nJune 24\nS- Do you despise the riches of His goodness, forbearance and longsuffering not knowing that the goodness of God leads you to repentance? Rom 2:4\n\nO- If God's goodness leads us to repentance but we take His goodness for granted to continue to sin, it is despising His goodness.\n\nA- I should never continue to sin and take for granted God's grace. It will end up in Judgment and wrath.\n\nP- God please help me to have a soft heart to always be sensitive to your promptings of my heart.",
