          "journal_date": "2026-06-06",
          "ocr_text": "```json\n{\n  \"ocr_text\": \"June 6\\nS- My son, if you became surety for your friend, if you have shaken your hands, pledge for a stranger you are snared by the words of your mouth, you have come into the hand of your friend. Go and humble yourself, and plead with your friend. Give no sleep to your eyes nor slumber to your eye lids. Deliver yourself like a gazelle from the hand of the fowl, and like a bird from the hand of the fowler. Proverbs 6\\n\\nO- Debt is a trap. Get out of debt as fast as you can. Dont let debt destroy you. It can eat you all at once and destroy every thing you have.\\n\\nA- I need to settle debt this week. Work on finance this week: Income generation, debt forgiveness, budgeting\\n\\nP- God the only way I can get out of debt is to start a marketing company. Or a jubilee. I'm 53 this year and would be awesome if you could grant me a jubilee from all my debt. I'm asking if you could grant me a jubilee from all my debt. I'm asking you to please release me of all debt to worship and serve you.\\n\\nJune 7\\nS- That in the dispensation of the fullness of time He might gather together in one all things in Christ. Both which are in heaven and which are on earth- in them. Eph. 1:10\\n\\nO- God's purpose is to gather all things in Christ. God's heart is unity. Unity with Himself. Unity of Humanity, unity between races, unity between those of different religions, unity in the church, unity in the home, unity in the workplace, but only in Christ. We can see this now. From 120 Jews in an upper room, to 3000 on Pentecost and thousands throughout Ephesus and now billions throughout the world. Christ is bringing everything together. Church/God/Bus/Family/Race\\n\\nA- God's heart is unity of all things through Christ. Babylon's heart is unity of all things without Christ. God's heart is unity of all things through sacrificial love and freedom. Babylon's heart is unity of all things through fear and oppression. If I don't choose Christ's side intentionally, I fear and oppression, other side through default. I will fall into the in LOVE through the WORD. I must Establish myself\\n\\nP- God thank you for sending Christ to write all my ambitions and live for you. To work the veins to bring you glory. To you be all both now and forever.\",\n  \"scripture_reference\": \"Proverbs 6, Ephesians 1:10\"\n}\n```",
