          "ocr_text": "```json\n{\n  \"ocr_text\": \"June 1\\nS- For this you know that no fornicator unclean person nor covetous man\\nwho is an idolater has any in heritance in the kingdom of Christ\\nand God. let no one deceive you with empty words for because of\\nthese things the wrath of God upon the sons of disobedience\\ntherefore do not be partakers in them. Eph 5: 5-7\\n\\nO- We can love so more than Christ and thus it's not acceptable\\nto expect a real \u0026 union with Christ if we do love things\\nmore than Him.\\n\\nA-I will pursue a faithful relationship with Christ to love\\nHim more than anything else. because He did, the same\\nfor me. knowing if I put Him first, He will add all things to me\\n\\nP- God please help me to understand your love and Faithfulness\\nto me and to be faithful in all things to you. In my\\nthoughts actions and character.\\n\\nJune 2\\nS- See then that you walk circumspectly, not as fools but as wise,\\nredeeming the time because the days are evil. Therefore\\ndo not be unwise but understand what the will of the Lord is Eph.5:4\\n\\nO- When we understand His will we can walk very carefully to\\navoid risk. Consider ALL possible consequences before acting.\\nGod's will is to prosper. God's will is blessed to be a blessing.\\nGod's will is NO DEBT.\\n\\nA- Circumspectly, cautious, aware, vigilant, intentional. Redeeming the\\ntime -make the best use of the time because days are full of\\ntemptations, distractions. I need to feel in my mind\\nwill, emotions. Focus on God's will. Walk wisely and intentionally\\n\\nP- God forgive me for wasting so many years. Thank you for\\nyour grace and the ability to redeem time. Please\\nhelp me to run the race that you gave me to run.\",\n  \"scripture_reference\": \"Ephesians 5:5-7, Ephesians 5:15-16\"\n}\n```",
