          "journal_date": "2026-06-20",
          "ocr_text": "He is coming back\n\nA: His return is soon. I must think in those terms p. God help me to keep your return at the forefront of my mind and thoughts.\n\nJune 20\n5- Women received their dead raised back to life again. Also we tortured not accepting deliverance that they might attain a better resurrection. Heb 11:35\n\nO- Faith in resurrection allow people to suffer with hope in the next life.\n\nA- If resurrection hope can impact people to suffer it can help people to live in a sacrificial way.\n\nP- God give me eyes to see the resurrection and... you have planned for your people.",
