          "ocr_text": "also effortless. That's good things preserved.\nA- I will use grace to produce good things. Not a I worthless selfish works.\nP- Lord help me to have confidence to approach you throne to find grace to grow.\n\nJune 20\nS- Therefore strengthen the hands which hang down and feeble knees and make straight the paths for your feet so that what is lame may not be dislocated but rather be healed. Heb 12:12,13\n\nO- No matter how bad things feel they can get worse or get better. Paul encourages the latter by strengthening what remains.\n\nA Getting older is inevitable, but getting weaker is not. I can eat better and exercise more. Spend more time with God and make my path clear straight by managing my time.\n\nP- God, please help me to walk closer to you and to strengthen my steps.",
