          "ocr_text": "May 24\nS- Meanwhile he also hoped that money would be given to him by Paul that he might release him. Therefore he sent for him more often and conversed with him. Acts 24:26\n\nO- Felix had the perception that Paul was wealthy or he wouldn't have bothered. Paul excelled and worked hard in everything that he did. He wasn't just a minister but a disciple maker and a successful businessman.\n\nA- My character is consistent across all verticals in my life. The more disciplined I am and devoted to God, I will have consistency in all areas of my life. The belief in resurrection and judgement field that.\n\nP- God please help me to be consistent for everything in my life.\n\nMay 25\nS- The eyes of your understanding being enlightened that you may know the hope of His calling what are the riches of the glory of it at the saints and what is the exceeding greatness of His power toward us who believe according to the working of His might power which He worked in Christ when He seated Him at the right hand in heavenly place far above all principalities of power, might and dominion and every name that is named not so in this age but also that which is to come Eph 1:20-21\n\nO- Our inheritance is shown in what happened to Jesus because as He is so we will be. We are a part of His body the fullness of Him.\n\nA- I will remain in Christ that as He died and rose, I will be found in Him. Not of myself or my own glory but be found in Him when He is revealed to the world in the fullness of His Bride.\n\nP- God give me eyes to see the end of what you have for me and for your Bride the church.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
