          "ocr_text": "A- I will look for those who are hungry and open and cooperate w/ the spirit instead of doing it my way.\n\nP- God please help me to be sensitive to your voice and to follow up on people who you are already moving in.\n\nMay 19\nS- Evil when some were hardened and did not believe but spoke evil of the way before the multitude he departed from and withdrew the disciples, reasoning daily in the school of Tyrannus. Also, many of those who practiced magic brought their books together and burned them in the sight of all. They counted up the value of them and it held fifty thousand pieces of silver. So the word of God grew, mightily and prevailed. Acts 19, 19-26 1866\n\nO- 30 Isa5,000 1866 - Slave purchases. Immense amount of money. 265 I wasn't just leaving at God but getting rid of evil. 196 Evil. 15 million in purchase power. 15,600 i Phones. 20 Not just the phones but the attention given to them. The word of God grew when distraction were destroyed.\n\nA- I need to trash my phone. Maybe a full fast of all scrolling on a phone\n\nP- God please help me to get rid of all things that are not of you and to give my heart and attention to you.\n\nMay 20\nS- And those who were with me indeed saw a light and were afraid but they did not hear the voice of him who spoke to me. Acts22:9\n\nO- God spoke to paul but it was not recognizable to anyone other than paul. When Jesus was glorified the voice was recognizable with Jesus and not by paul. I was with someone who he was speaking to. When God speaks to someone it will be for that person only\n\nA- I shouldn't expect others to hear what God is speaking to me. I should focus on hearing his voice, then obey what he is telling me. Not consulting others.\n\nP- God help me to fear you most and to give careful attention to what you speak to me. Thank you for loving me enough to speak to me.",
