          "journal_date": "2026-05-06",
          "ocr_text": "May 6\nS- And Jesus went all about Galilee teaching in their synagogues preaching the gospel of the kingdom and healing all kinds of sickness and all kinds of disease among people. Math 4:23\n\nO- Jesus went everywhere teaching - in synagogues - Healing.\n\nA- Peter Go - Teach - Heal - Preach. This is taught in Luke 10 and in Acts.\n\nP- God please use me to teach your word. To heal the sick. And preach your kingdom.\n\nMay 7\nS- Not everyone who says to me Lord Lord will enter the kingdom of heaven, but he who does the will of my Father in heaven. MANY will say to me in that day \"Lord Lord, have we prophesied in your name cast out demons in your name, done many wonders in your name\n\nD- Not a few will go to hell and be seperated from Christ.\n\nA- I want to do the will of the Father in heaven.\n\nP- God help me to obey you in action. Not in just in word.\n\nMay 8\nS- Blessed is the man who listens to me, swallowing daily at my gates waiting by posts of my door. Prov 8:34\n\nO- As a coach expect his player to listen, watch and wait for his calls. God expects us to pay attention to His direction. There is a promise of favor if we do.\n\nA- I need to listen watch and wait on the Lord much more than I do. Its so easy to not give myself to what the Lord wants. God pls give me grace to walk in the Spirit.\n\nP- God help me to walk in your ways. To know your love and hate what you hate. Give me the ability to love your people humbly and to sacrifice the love for her. To be faithful to her.",
