          "ocr_text": "A- God will guide me to those who are open and place\nCommonals with them where I can share things in the gospel\nwith them.\n\nP- God help me to be able to win Ryan and Raj to\nChrist. Help me to be able to baptize Raj, James and\nRyan one day.\n\nMay 17 - Sermon Prep.\n3 convo's\n1. Justin; Hard time reading\n2. Aaron - favorite 36 when we SOAP together\n3. David - Get so much more when we do it together.\n\nText: Continued in the Apostle Doctrine, Fellowship, Breaking of Bread\nand prayers. Acts 2:42. Break up into groups of 2-3\nLook for people you\ndon't know.\n\nInteractive Sermon - Sunday Morning Small Group-\n1. Read Word- LEFT, CENTER, RIGHT - 5 verses each - 7min\n2. Discuss curious scriptures - 8+4min\n3. SOAP-10 min - 2 BN / 2min / 2min / 2min\n4. Discuss- Smin\n5. Communion - 3min\n6. Prayer - 5min\n\n_Intro 2 Sconvos /\n 4 Text from last week Acts 2:42\n 3 - Small Group Sunday Morning\n\nSteps- Stand - Find 2 -Soap then sit.\n\nExplain - SLIDE 7\n       Read\n       Discuss\n       SOAP          - USE Bible/Back of Hand out/Notebook/iNote\n       Discuss\n       Pray.\n\nMay 14\nS - And he departed from there and entered the house\n    man Justus she also worshipped God, whose house was next\n    to the synagogue)\n\nO - This was the same as Lydia, in the previous chapter. Celler\n    of people, God looked for people who worshipped him. Interesting\n    God didn't send apostles to people who didn't worship him for\n    people who were hard hearted.",
