          "ocr_text": "April 27\nS- When there heard about the spike in their in the language they kept all alike mixed, silent and be careful. Acts 2:1\n\nO- Paul had time to share dual within He did, he always shared his testimony. Something people loved. Other times they didn't. Some supported. Others hated.\n\nA- I must be faithful to share stories of God's careful mess and equip others\n\nP- God help me to walk with you growing in those with you and others\n\nApril 28\nS- But when Paul perceived that one part were Sadducees and the other Pharisees he cried out in the council \"Men and brethren, I am a Pharisee, the son of a Pharisee, concerning the hope and resurrection of the dead am I being judged. And when he had said this, a dissension arose between the Pharisees and the Sadducees, and the assembly was divided. Acts 23:6-7\n\nO- Paul was the enemy of both. And complained he was no match they were much more in number. So he identified difference in belief and spite the belief of one that was contradicted by the other, that said he was being persecuted. The group resonated with his belief and offense and sided with him and it divided the group so he could win. This happens in politics, marriage, church, Satan divides to conquer.\n\nA- I must realize satan is on no ones side but his own. If I have a strong belief and chose that is splitting my country, my family, my church, I need to focus on stopping the problem of the enemy. Not holding to my belief and offense.\n\nP- Lord help my identity to be found in you and not my belief in anything else. Right",
