          "ocr_text": "April 19\nS- Do not be afraid but speak and do not keep silent, for I am with you and no one will attack you, for I have many people in this city. Acts 18:9-10\nO- Fear of attack kept Pauls mouth closed. The Holy Spirit told him to share and there were many odd bad in the city.\nA- I must not be afraid to speak because God has given me a message\nP- God give me boldness to share the truth of the gospel of heaven coming back\n\nApril 20\nS- So I have shown you in every way, by laboring like this that you must support the weak. And remember the words of Jesus that it said it is more blessed to give than to receive. Acts 20:35\nO- Paul went from house to house. Preaching in public and face to face. And gave of his money and time in a way that showed love for the poor and weak. Through modeling a strong and sacrificial work ethic of teaching He imparted passion for the kingdom.\nA- I need to have more engagement of time to teach the kingdom of God. Death \u0026 Resurrection.\nP- God give me grace and health to share your gospel with every one who you call.\n\nApril 21\nS- And some of the multitude cried one thing and some another so when he could not ascertain the truth because of the tumult he commanded him to be taken into the barracks Acts 25:9\nO- Emotion overtakes logic everytime. Those that want to stir up trouble are able to with details. Truth is hard to discern when emotional crowds are involved.\nA- It's now wise to battle emotional crowds. STUK is a brand. Nothing to do with STUK we need a new brand.\nP- God give me wisdom to solve the housing crisis on Maui.",
