          "ocr_text": "Nagoya- Pastor did everything. EmPower everyone.\n- New Hope kept serving teams til people stayed.\n- Important to send and stay.\n\nSpend time with LORD.- Prayer\nLOST - Answers to Prayer\nLEADERS\n\nApril 17\nS- Titus 3 Paul's custom was went in to them and for free\nsalisfied reasoned with them from scriptures. Acts 17:2\n\nO- Paul always had a rhythm to share the faith. He started\nwith those who knew scripture. He reasoned with them.\nHe was looking for those seeking truth. Went to synagogues\nto find and reason with them and the Holy Spirit confirmed\nwith signs.\n\nA- The Holy Spirit confirmed. He led them into the witness\nand they had to share and reason and to those\nwho believed. God confirmed with signs.\n\nP- God please help me to give my devotion and attention\nto the Lord, the Lost and Leaders.\n\nApril 18\nS There were more fair minded than those in Thessalonica in that\nthey received the Word with all readiness and searched the\nscriptures daily to find out whether these things were so.\nTherefore many of them believed,... Acts 17\n\nO- Those who daily searched scripture daily more readily obey\nbelieved, and received the Word\n\nA- The greatest openness exist in people who read the Bib\n\nP- P should position myself with people who love His\nword and are seeking for truth.",
