          "ocr_text": "April 15.\n\nS- Then after some days Paul said to Barnabas' Let us go back and visit our brethren in every city where we have preached the word of Jesus and see how they are doing. Acts 15: 36\n\nO- Paul went great for years to build relationship and build connections and share good for years at a time. the Souest revest areas where people believed.\n\nA- Where is God calling me to today? Who has God called me to and how can I build bridges and financial ties to help people live out their faith. How can I help these people? I built a skill and make money then preach without.\n\nP- God help me to be faith with the gifts that you have given to me.\n\nApril 16\n\nS- Now when they had gone from Phrygia and the region of Galatia they were forbidden by the Holy Spirit to preach the Word in Asia. They were called to Macedonia instead. Acts 16\n\nO- Care that he not only doing the right thing but the right direction, right time ect.\n\nA- I must seek the direction of God. Do more things as He speaks to me more.\n\nP- God please lead me. Help my last 30yrs of life to be more impactful than the first 50yrs.\n\nApril 29 Roundtable\n• Power of testimony - unleash it. - Samoa Mission - To plant a church that plants by 2027\n• Mission - lavuish - Gary and Paul. Australia Samoa\n• Samoa - kelo / lustin ? Ron Samoa\n• Wade couple from Okinawa Fiji\n• Nagpa - Parkside plant. - 300small churches. What is our vision\n• French \u0026 Model Visions. - Fire bomb churches.\n• A church planting church. Starts with a soul winning person.\n\nGOAL Micro MS Legitimize prayer\nHealthy O O Church Microsite giving\nSmallGroups O\nMicrosites site Song Sermon\n15/20",
