          "ocr_text": "A getting older is inevitable, but I can eat better and exercise more. Spend more time with God and make my path clear staying by managing my time.\n\nP- God please help me to walk closer to you to strengthen my steps.\n\nJune 22\n\nS- Now may, the God of peace who brought up our lord Jesus from the dead, that great shepherd of the sheep through the blood of the everlasting covenant make you complete in every good work to do His will, working in you what is well and pleasing in His sight through Jesus to whom be glory forever and ever amen. Hebrews\n\nO- God raised Christ and works in us with the power through Him.\n\nA- IF God can raise Jesus from the dead He can awaken in my dead works to serve the living God.\n\nP- God help me to follow you with all my heart",
