          "ocr_text": "April 7th\nS- Isiah Isaiah is very bold and says \"I was found by those who did not seek me, I was manifest to those who did not ask for me. Rom 10:20\n\nO- bad chooses who he reveal himself to. Jesus says those who obey but also those who don't seek. Ultimately God chooses who he wants.\n\nA- I must be grateful to God for choosing me to be his son.\n\nP- God thank you for loving and choosing us even when I wasn't seeking you.\n\nApril8th\nS- Then they had hands laid on them and they received the Holy Spirit. Acts 8:17\n\nO- The Holy Spirit was shown with power. With signs \u0026 wonders. Healings and deliverances. And great Joy in the city.\n\nA- Do the Holy Spirit verified the message with signs and wonders I should also pray for signs \u0026 wonders.\n\nP- God give me faith to believe you will do it and help me to walk in purity.\n\nApril 9th\nS- But Saul increased all the more in strength and confounded the Jews who dwelt in damascus proving that this Jesus is the Christ. Acts 9:22\n\nO- Increased practice results in increased strength. Saul was beginning to shift gears and using passion to preach instead of persecute because he encountered Christ.\n\nA- As I encounter Christ He will change my passion for the wrong things into a passion for the right things.\n\nP- God please help me to encounter you each day so my passions and ambitions to shift to your Kingdom.",
