          "ocr_text": "April 2\nS- For if you live according to the flesh you will die, but if the Spirit you will have life. The deeds of the body you will live. Rom 8:13\n\nO- There is a war on the inside that I must win. It is the war against the Flesh. Eyes, flesh, pride. This is the most important battle I under win. The fruit was taken in selfishness and pride. The tree of life was taken away.\n\nA- I must be careful when partaking of the tree of life. I can't take eat of His love without the wrong guard. The sacrament must be taken with a selfless attitude. Also marriage must be participated in with a selfless heart to give life.\n\nP- God, help me to be faithful to my wife. To live in a way as a servant to her. To love her for you. Please cleanse me and make me a husband who reflects you.\n\nApril 3\nS- Not only that, but we also who have the first fruits of the Holy Spirit even us ourselves groan within ourselves, eagerly awaiting for adoption the redemption of our bodies. Rom 8:23\n\nO- There is a day when our bodies will be redeemed. We will be resurrected and live here on earth with an incorruptible body to love, serve, enjoy Jesus and His creation.\n\nA- I should live to be in selfless community with Jesus, my family and my church. If I act in a selfless way I may participate in the first resurrection. Which would be crazy!\n\nP- God please help me to understand the call that you have for my life. Help me not to stumble it but to treat you with the honor you deserve.",
