          "ocr_text": "march 4\nS-Guard your heart with all diligence for out of it springs the issues of life. Guard from you the deceitful mouth. And put forth your ear, look right before you. Ponder the path of your feet and let all your ways be established. Proverbs 4:23-26 Remove your feet from evil. Prov 4:27-27\n\nO-Guarding my heart involves #1 guarding what I say #2 guarding my eyes, #3 guarding my plans/schedule. #4 Guarding my habits #5Guarding my discipline (consistency) #6 Guarding integrity.\n\nA- I will pay more attention to my speech, plans, eyes \u0026 ears, habits and integrity\n\nP- God thank you for your love for my life, please help me to guard my heart with ALL diligence. Help my thoughts, eyes, tears, association and inputs. Help me to speak life and not death.\n\nMarch 5\nS- Remove your way FAR from her and do not go NEAR the door of her house. Let you give your honor to others. and your years to the cruel one. Prov 5:8\n\nO- The instruction here is to make great distance between me and the immoral woman. Distance brings safety. The further away, the more effort is needed, more time, intention, energy it takes to sin. Make it difficult to sin.\n\nA- I should make things extremely difficult to traverse into grey areas. Remove thing that are \"near\" easily accessible.\n\nP- God you ponder my path. You see everything. Help me to follow and obey you. To seek your wisdom that will protect me from immorality. Help me to walk in integrity, transparency. Help me to walk before you in a way that is blameless.",
