          "ocr_text": "March 31\nS- He who has my commandments and keeps them, it is he who loves me. And he also loves me will be loved by my Father, and I will love him and manifest myself to him.\nJohn 14:21.\n\nO- The Father loves the world, but there is a more intimate love that goes both ways. God loves the world glues seeds our obedience, His love and revelations of himself. Obedience = intimacy/revelations\n\nA - I am glad and grateful for God's awareness but want to grow in love and obedience that will lead to intimacy.\n\nP- God please help me to love serve obey you for the reward of knowing you more.\n\n\nApril 1\nIntroduction to God Friday\n\nS- But if the Spirit of Him who raised Jesus from the dead dwells in you, He who raised Christ from the dead will also give life to your mortal bodies through His Spirit who dwells in you.\nRom 8:11\n\nO- There is a power that resides in us that is great. It raised Christ from the dead and can give life to us.\n\nA- There is nothing in this world more powerful than the Spirit of God who dwells in me. But His strength is made perfect in weakness. So even in the worst situation I can be assured of victory. Even in death there is the promise and hope of resurrection.\n\nP- God thank you for giving me your Spirit. I feel that your Spirit is operating in my life way below my potential because my flesh is so strong. Help me to surrender to you in mind will and emotions.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
