          "ocr_text": "march 26.\nS- I will deliver you from the jewish people as well as from the gentiles\nto whom I now send you to open their eyes in order to turn\nthem from darkness to light and from the power of Satan\nto God that they may receive forgiveness of sins and an\ninheritance among those who are sanctified by faith in\nme. Acts26:17,18\n\nO- God sends us to open eyes. from darkness to light. from Satan's\npower to God's power. This results in salvation \u0026 obedience.\n\nA- I need to be walking in the light myself before I can\nhelp others go from darkness to light.\n\nP- Lord thank you for your grace and love. Hill turn away\nfrom being ignorant and help me be called sin. I will live a\ndisciplined life.\n\nActs march 27\nS- for though you had heard be me this night can cancel all the God to\nwhom I belong and whom I serve saying Do not be\nafraid Paul. you must be brought before Caesar and indeed God\nhas granted you all those who sail with you. Act 27:23-24\n\nO- God protected even the prisoners because paul\nneeded to reach those, those around him were pressured.\n\nA- When we are walking in the will of God, even those\naround us will end up being bled. Testimonies are\nformed through our obedience\n\nP- God help me to abide in you. to walk in obedience\nand to be someone who had a voice\n\n#\nMarch 28\nS- However they were expecting that he would swell up or suddenly\nfall down dead, but after they had looked for a long time\nand saw no harm come to him, they changed their minds\nand said that he was a god. Acts 28:6.\n\nO- People can be incredibly fickle. They went from believing he\nwas a murderer to believing he was a god because\nhe didn't die as they predicted.\n\nA- I should not put a lot of weight on what others think of\nme because what people think or say can change in an instant.\nI must live for what God thinks alone.\n\nP- God that you think of me often for thoughts are of\ngood and not evil. To give me a hope and restore.",
