          "ocr_text": "June 28\n6- For I long to see you that I may impart to you some spiritual gift so that you may be established; that is, that we may be encouraged together with you by the mutual faith of you and me. Rom 1:11,12\n\nO- When we struggle there we also get encouraged and strengthened in our faith. fellowship is a two way street.\n\nA- I will need always ready to disciple as possible to myself in my faith.\n\nP- God give me grace to repent, be baptized and filled with your Spirit.",
