          "ocr_text": "Feb 24\nS- To you Galad in the day of adversity your strength is small? Prov. 24;10\n\nO- Strength is only leaded through adversity. God wants to help me, my strength or make me stronger, he will give me adversity.\n\nA- When I'm failing it shows that I need strength. I see that I need to rely and get it from Jesus or get it from grace. I can get it from discipline. I can get it through training and pain.\n\nP- God please give me strength to win my battles.\n\nFeb 26\nS- Whatever has no rule over his spirit is like a city broken down without walls. Prov 25;28\n\nO- I have a yeast infection from the yeast being in a place where it can grow and attack. My skin's follicles couldn't fight it. It needed a flu killer.\n\nA- Light kills this stuff quick. I need light that a removal of the crap that seeps into my life.\n\nD- God help me to lay aside every sin and weight which so easily poses me and run with patience the race set before me\n\nFeb 26\nS- As a dog returns to his own vomit so a fool repeats his folly. Prov 26;11\n\nO- This is a perfect picture of things in my life. I need to learn how to get out of the recursive loop of failure in my life.\n\nA- I need to see myself the way that God sees me. To spend time in His presence. Listening to Him is the only thing that will change us.\n\nP- God I don't know why I don't spend more time with you. I know that you love me but I feel so distant from you",
