          "ocr_text": "Feb 9\nS- Of the vine God had having passed up His second Jesus said Him to bless you for following away every one of you forgive your thoughts. Math 3:26\n\nO- Jesus blessed them not only by touching but twisting them away from their sin.\n\nA- I will not only see the goodness of God but the blessing of turning away from my sin.\n\nP- God please grant me the gift of repentance of turning away from every thought to be sin and to purify you with all my heart.\n\nFeb 10\nS- He who gathers in summer is a wise son. He also sleeps in harvest causes shame. Prov 10:5\n\nO- If there is a harvest and I am not working it is a shameful thing.\n\nA- There is a harvest on the island of Haiti. There is a harvest in ABC town. How many people am I discipling there and how many people am I talking through the [word]?\n\nP- God my heart is cold. I need help. Can you restore is wild my mind cause it's cooled.\n\nFeb 11\nS- The righteousness of the upright will deliver them, but the unlawful will be caught by their lusts. Prov 11:6\n\nO- There is deliverance that comes from righteousness and having integrity there comes from sin but that comes from unfaithfulness and giving into lust.\n\nA- the more I give into lust the more suggestible I be come to the enemy. I need walls of self discipline, faithfulness, and righteousness in my life.\n\nP- God forgive me and change my heart mind actions. Help me to have integrity of heart.",
