          "ocr_text": "much when they had preached the gospel to that city, and made many disciples, they returned again to Lystra, and to Iconium, and Antioch, confirming the souls of the disciples, and exhorting them to continue in the faith, and that we must abide many tribulations enter into the kingdom of God. Acts 14:21,22\n\nA- Since disciples stayed in places that persuaded them, often went to other areas to make discipler\n\n- In ruling US where the Buyer is an ultimate discipline of the spirit of Christ, I must live apostolic to spit of where God is leading\n\n- Lord please help me to keep and obey your spirit and to walk with you to reach the world\n\nMarch 15\n\nS- Because I judge that we should not trouble those from among the gentiles who are turning to God, but that we write to them to abstain from things polluted by idols, from sexual immorality, from things strangled and from blood. Acts 15: 19,20\n\nO- How much discernment did this take at such a large line of faith, made the new covenant that all circumcision. How did Paul see that circumcision was a shadow \u0026 a circumcision of heart. What areas today are ceremonial laws and traditions that we hold us the Spirit.\n\nA- Paul saw the Spirit of God moving on Gentiles and realized that the Spirit didn't reject the gentiles due to their not being circumcised. I must look to where the Spirit is moving and changing lives and cooperate with them.\n\nP- Lord thank you for saving me. Help me to create a place where you are welcome and where you can move in the lives of people you have called\n\nMarch 16\n\nS- And he took them the same hour of the night and washed their stripes. And immediately he and all his family were baptized. Acts 16:33\n\nO- When the Spirit transforms an individual it can happen quickly completely and impact their entire family. Forgiveness was the unlock.\n\nA- Sometimes I must have an urgency regarding salvation when God is obviously doing in someones life.\n\nP- God help me to be sensitive to your spirit in your work in someone's life",
