          "ocr_text": "so the trampling and unfinished said \"send what you want and go into the city and you will be told what you need to do.\" Acts 9:6\n\nmany times God doesn't tell us the whole command with His disciples it was \"wait until the Holy Spirit comes on you. Here it was - go to the city.\" (place)\n\nI always want to know everything. I want the full picture. But God wants me to trust in the fullest obedience without understanding. It's a lot to learn to trust God and obey even if I don't see the long term plan.\n\nP- God's your Word is a lamp to my feet and a light to my path. Help me to obey even when the long term plan is unclear.\n\nMarch 10\n\nS- And when he observed him, being afraid and said \"What is it Lord?\" so he said \"Your prayers and your alms have come up for a memorial before God. Acts 10:4\n\nO- What we do and what we say reaches heaven. God sees all and rewards the diligent with more responsibility.\n\nA- I will look at all blessings as a stewardship of God and when I do a good job, God will reward me with people, appointments, knowledge of himself alliances with a similar heart\n\nP- God help me to be a good steward of all of the people and resources you have given to me.\n\nMarch 11\n\nS- Then one of them named Agabus stood up and showed by the Spirit that there was going to be a great famine throughout all the world which also happened in the days of Claudius Caesar\n\nO- The Spirit of God warned them through a member that a great famine would overtake the world.\n\nA- There are many gifts of the spirit that can benefit the body of Christ. I have gifts to give.\n\nP- God help me not to bury the gifts you have placed in my life.",
