          "ocr_text": "Feb 16\nS- And why should I find a good thing and also obtaining\nlater at that Lord that 18:22\n\nO- When I found a wife, I also found she Godly\ndo. I delight in unity with my wife. I must walk and\nwith integrity.\n\nA- Before I need to see my wife as an image of\nthe glory of God. Even things that are difficult\nI need also embrace knowing she is working through\nmy wife daily also.\n\nP- God help me to treat Jose as an instrument of your\nflavor and blessing in my life.\n\nFeb 19\nS- Homes and riches are an inheritance from fathers\nbut a prudent wife is from the Lord Pro 19:14\n\nO- God the greatest thing you have given me is a wonderful\nwife. Thank you for that gift. It wonderful\n\nA- I will take time to treasure her and be grateful\nfor her every day. She is the best woman\nI could ever be blessed with.\n\nP- God help me to honor, respect be grateful for my\nwife. She is a gift from you for granted. Help\nme to treasure her and cherish her.\n\nFeb 20\nS- Blows that hurt cleanse away evil, as do stripes the\ninner depths of the heart. Pro 20:30\n\nO- Pain with Peace produces righteousness. No discipline\nis pleasant but is painful but yields fruit of\npeace.\n\nA- I must welcome the pain of discipline knowing\nit will produce righteousness. Even the pain of\ndeath can purged someone of sin.\n\nP- God thank you that you love Mike and his father\nPut Peace in Mikes heart that you are in control.\nProtect his heart from fear or worry.",
