          "ocr_text": "July 24\nS. Jacob woke clothes and a man wrestled w/ him all night. When the sun rose Jacob's thigh was touched, thus many shall worship God and not be blessed. Strength wrestling w/ God and we are persevered.\n\nO. What Jacob did to private to restore peace with his uncle and prevent generously. He bowed to greeting him and inheritance because he traveled collection w/ custom, above to make peace w/ men.\n\nA. I need to walk wisely w/ men and strive w/ God. Through the private struggles my children will be growing in God help me. Thank you for always being with me at all times through all seasons. I can trust you b/c of grace because you are good.\n\nJuly 25\nP. The Proverbs of Solomon son of David, King of Israel's Prov 1:1\n\nO. Solomon starts this book by identifying Wisdom w/ a great but deeply flawed king. David could have been hated by everyone his own son and clement allies tried to dethrone him. Solomon didn't distance himself from David but honored him as a father. But although he was humble and identified the reason. He knew he was king. He was wise too.\n\nA. I must be humble. Honor authority. Defend the reputation of. But always be confident in my call.\n\nP. God help me to know the balance in humility and confidence in my call. Thank you for a great heritage and call to lead. Help me to lead well.\n\nJuly 26\nS. To (know) wisdom and instruction, to (perceive) the words of understanding. To (receive) the instruction of wisdom. Justice judgement and equity. Prov 1:2,3\n\nO. Wisdom judgement, Justice all have a voice. I can have a relationship w/ these spirits. They have personality and are real.\n\nA. I need to see the spirit realm as real and acting upon the physical.\n\nP. Lord thank you for giving me wisdom. Thank you for giving me the ability to hear your voice true me the grace to walk it out and apply it.",
