          "ocr_text": "Jan 21\nS- Then they will call on me and I will not answer. They will seek me diligently and will not find me because of they hated knowledge and did not choose the fear of the Lord. Prov 1:28-29\n\nO- God is not reaping and if I choose to not fear God and do my own thing there will be consequences to pay.\n\nA- I need to pay attention to my own heart and soul. I need to know if I'm humble and hungry.\n\nP- God please help me to desire you more than anything. Help me to seek you first\n\nJan 22\nS- The wicked will be cut off from the earth and the unfaithful will be uprooted from it. Prov 2:22.\n\nO- There will be a people who stay on the earth. They will be righteous and faithful.\n\nA- There is a question of my faithfulness. I pursue money and riches more than God. I take more time thinking and pursuing wealth. I want to have a faithful heart.\n\nP- God please guide me to faithfulness. God I will always please you and let faithfulness flow you more than anything in the world. Help us to walk in your power and anointing.\n\nJan 23\nS- My son do not despise the chastening of the Lord nor despise his correction. For whom the Lord loves he corrects. Just as a father the son in whom he delights. Prov 3:11, 12\n\nO- Correction is a sign of not only family but of delight. God corrects His children out of lack of performance not delight. God tells Jesus in whom I'm well pleased. Pleasure and delight sent about performance but about family. I delight in my kids cause they are my kids. Alex's is right\n\nA- Correction from God is because He already delights in me. He is pleased w/ me. Wants to spend time in us.\n\nP- Thank you God that you love me favor me, delight in me and want to hang out with me. You want my attention and I so easily give it to other things. Help me to love you and",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
