          "journal_date": "2026-01-12",
          "ocr_text": "Jan 11\nS- because you have chosen this thing and have not withheld\nsorr, your only son blessing I will bless you\nI will multiply your descendants as the stars of the heaven\nand the sand of the sea shore and your descendants shall\npossess the gates of their enemies. In your seed shall\nall the nations of the earth be blessed because you\nhave obeyed my voice. Gen 22:15-16\n\nO- our willingness to give to God what is the most precious\nthing to ourselves positions us to impact the world.\nGod chooses the obedient and sacrificial.\n\nA- I must be obedient and sacrificially generous\nfor the sake of the gospel.\n\nP- Lord please help me to be generous with the\nabundance you will pour out on my life.\n\nJan 12\nS- Then Jacob awoke from his sleep and said \"Surely the Lord is in\nthis place and I did not know it. Gen 28:16\n\nO- Many times God is present and we can be unaware of it. God\nrevealed Himself to Jacob in his sleep. Also Joseph. And Adam\nand Abraham. Why does God reveal Himself so many times\nwhen we rest?\n\nA- I need to learn to silence my own thoughts. To be\nstill in my heart \u0026 mind. To practice His presence\nbecause He is always with me as I'm a example of\nthe Holy Spirit, and many times I don't know it.\n\nP- God help me to rest in your blessing at your\npresence. Help me to be aware that you\nare with me to protect, provide and be present.",
