          "journal_date": "2026-01-08",
          "ocr_text": "Jan 8, 2026\nS- Abraham departed as the Lord had spoken to him and Lot went with him. Abraham was 75yrs old when he departed Haran. Gen 12:1-4\n\nO- Abram left country, family, home to follow the Lord. All things give identity! God wants his identity. God. He also left at 75yrs old to have a child. [This was an impossible task.]\n\nA- It's never too late to follow Christ! To leave and cleave. He still went with his family and his nephew.\n\nP- God help me to walk with you to get my identity from you and no one else, nothing else.\n\nJan 9 2026\nS- When Abram went up from Egypt he and his wife and all he had went to the south. Abram was very rich in livestock in silver and gold. Gen 13:1, 2\n\nO- Abraham became wealthy amongst Eminence. He too was sinful in lying about his wife. But God still prospered him.\n\nA- God can prosper us even in famine. Even in weakness, bad government, bad cupboards, all doors us.\n\nP- God please let my heart to be right. Sola Scripture, Sola faith, Sola Christ, Sola Grace, Sola His glory.\n\nJan 10 2026:\nS- Then he said \"Let not the Lord be angry and I will speak but once more. Suppose 10 should be found there and he said \"I will not destroy it for the sake of 10\". Gen 18:32\n\nO- Abraham bargained w/ God for the fate of a city. Gen 18 nothing negotiate with Abraham! God revealed this him because he was already viewing him as someone with influence.\n\nA- God will give greater revelation to me as my influence becomes greater.\n\nP- God help me to steward revelation better",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1781663985543.jpg",
