          "journal_date": "2026-01-03",
          "ocr_text": "Jan 3, 2026\nS- And He said 'what have you done? The voice of your brothers blood cries out to me from the ground. Now you are cursed with to facing your brothers blood from the ground. When you till the ground it shall no longer yield its strength to you. A fugitive and a vagabond you shall be on the earth. Genesis 10-12\n\nO- Cities became the gathering place of those who can't cultivate soil. There is a poverty of scarcity mindset in the cities that will fill the earth. Cities became a hub for trade.\n\nA- I need to have an abundance mindset. Scarcity produces value. When values = money = timeloevergy. God doesn't have a scarcity mindset. He gives and allows others to give back as they want.\n\nP- God help me to have an abundant mindset. To give Greatly of everything that you have given me. Thank you for helping me to build an amazing community of entrepreneurs.\n\nJan 4 2026\nS- Be Cain shall be avenged 7 fold. Lamech shall be avenged 77X fold. Genesis\n\nO- Lamed, killed 2 men and assumed that the grace of God was a license to sin. God and the greater sin could give greater grace. This produces evil in the earth where only the pickled lived. God needed to destroy the earth and set new rules. Grace makes people who are evil become more evil.\n\nA- I cannot take advantage of the grace of God that will eventually lead to judgement. God is gracious but is also just. So He is patient and long suffering so all have a chance to repent.\n\nP- God help me to not take your long suffering and grace for granted. Help me to lead your people with love and diligence.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
