          "ocr_text": "Jan 6, 2026\nS- Then he he said, \"Cursed be Cain an, A servant of servants de\nshall be unto his brethren. Gen 9:25\nvisit the iniquity of the third a 4th generation, but showing\ncheest love to thousand of generations to those who love\nme and keep my commandments\" Ex 20:5,6\n\nO- Although wicked men impacts generation 2-4 deep righteousness\nimpacts thousands deep, which we do good has\na much greater impact than what we do bad.\n\nA- I must not fear making mistakes. God's favor impacts\nthousand of generations deep.\n\nP- God help me to never get discouraged by what\nI do that feels like failures. Help me to rest in\nyour love and grace for my life.\n\nJan 7, 2026\nS- And the Lord said \"Indeed the people are one and they all have\none language and this is what they begin to do. Now nothing\nwill be that they propose will be with held.\" Gen 11:6\n\nO- Unity and language can bring about an unstoppable force\nthat would disrupt God's plans. God stepped in to confuse\nthe plans that man had opposite to his will.\n\nA- P leadership is uniting energy/resources/ownership/purpose\nidentity/anti-Purpose) Language Jesus is our leader.\nAll our resources belong to him for the purpose of making\ndisciples, so people won't go to hell and can be children\nof God with a promise of resurrection\n\nP- God help me to be a better follower of you and a better\nleader of your church.",
