          "ocr_text": "Jan 1, 2026\nS- Do well will you not be accepted? And if you do not do well, sin lies at the door and its desire is for you but do you should rule over it. Gen 4:7\n\nO- My struggle with sin is directly tied to my offering being acceptable. If I do well there will be acceptance of being a Lord and sweet fellowship. If I don't do well, I will struggle with sin.\n\nA- I don't need to focus on not sinning. I must focus on serving God with all my heart soul mind and strength. This begins with being in the word.\n\nP- God please forgive me for not give you lost of who I am. Please help me to serve you with all my heart soul mind and strength and to love my neighbor as myself.\n\nJan 2, 2026\nS- Cain talked to Abel his brother in the field and it came to pass that Cain rose up against Abel his brother and killed him. Gen 4:8\n\nO- The worker of the field had a poverty mindset. He felt like if he took away from his brother there would be more for himself. Scarcity minded believes for me to have more, others need to have less. Power, wealth, flesh—\n\nA- This will drive someone to murder others. Real success comes from lifting others up and seeing them succeed and focusing on making my own life pleasing to the Lord. He will supply. He will promote. He will prosper me.\n\nP- God help me to trust you. To worship you with all my heart soul mind and strength. To love others with your love. To eliminate distractions and offense in my life to be a pleasing sacrifice to you.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1781664032691.jpg",
