          "import_batch_id": null,
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2026-06-15",
          "ocr_text": "lie. In the lineage of kings. Conquerors.\n\nA- A new testament had begun with Jesus as the high priest. We are all kings and priest to our God. Jesus was a priest on earth, but a king now. I shall Allow Jesus as a part of a kingdom of priests.\n\nD- God give us eyes to see what you have called the church and your people to. Help me to serve your people and call them to Royalty.\n\nJune 17\n\nS- For this is the covenant that I will make with them in those days with the hose of towards the Lord. I will put my laws in their mind and write them on their hearts and I will be their God and they shall be my people. None of them shall teach his neighbor and none his brother saying know the Lord for all shall know me from the least of them to the greatest of them. For I will be merciful to their unrighteousness and their sins and lawless deeds I will remember no more Hb\n\nO- God's mercy is promised and a new covenant of loving Jesus from the heart and not maintaining the law.\n\nA- God will establish the covenant with his people by forgiving sin and placing laws on their hearts and minds. I will be graceful for grafting me into the vine and writing His laws on my mind and heart.\n\nP- Thank you Jesus for choosing me to be grafted into the vine. Help me to see the great gift you have given to me and to love others and have the love and patience you have for your people.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
