          "journal_date": "2026-06-18",
          "ocr_text": "June 18\nS- And as it is appointed for men to die once but then after\n   this the judgement, so christ was offered once to bear\n   the sins of many. To those who eagerly wait for Him He\n   will appear a second time apart from sin, for salvation.\n                                                    Heb 9:27,28\n\nO- Jesus died once for our sins but when He appears it\n   will be for our resurrection.\n\nA- I will live my life in a way to look forward to\n   the resurrection when Christ appears again\n\nP- God please help me to fix my eyes on your return\n   and to be ready.\n\nJune 19",
