          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2026-06-19",
          "ocr_text": "O- Jesus died once for our sins but when He appears it will be for our resurrection.\n\nA- I will live my life in a way to look forward to the resurrection when Christ appears again.\n\nP- God please help me to fix my eyes on your return and to be ready.\n\nJune 19:\nS- For yet a little while and He who is coming will come and will not tarry. Now the just shall live by faith but if anyone draw back my soul has no pleasure in him. Heb 10:37, 38\n\nO- Jesus is coming back soon and I need live like He is coming back\n\nA- His return is soon. I must think in those terms\n\nP- God help me to keep your return at the forefront of my mind and thoughts.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
