          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "52651027-72b0-430d-81a1-c1a801b90f37",
          "import_batch_id": null,
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2026-06-26",
          "ocr_text": "June 25-Gen 1, P.1, Prov 1, Matt 1, Rom 1\nS- Then God saw everything that He had made and indeed it was VERY GOOD, so the evening and morning was the 6th day. Gen1:31\n\nO- Evening was created before the morning. The day started with night. The night was the backdrop for the day. The day, for instance, had a canvas to paint the sun and stars. Disorder 2 Chaos had to be before order and unity. God is a master artist waiting. Hovering over the darkness to begin the story.\n\nA- Every mistake I make. Every mess. Every obstacle. Every disappointment becomes a beautiful canvas for God to create a story of deliverance. A story of Hope. A story of breakthrough. There would be no light without darkness. No deliverance w/o bondage. No Exodus w/o Pharaoh. No King David without a Goliath. No resurrection without a cross and tomb. The Spirit of God hovers over the Darkness waiting for the activation of the spoken word of God. The spoken Word of God creates the light in the darkness.\n\nP- God please speak into my darkness. Let there be light. Where there is light darkness cannot exist. Light in my mind, light in my relationships, marriage, family, finances, community, workplace, church, Government education and business.\n\nJune 26",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1782891462595.jpg",
