          "journal_date": "2026-06-28",
          "ocr_text": "June 27\nS- Now after the birth of Jesus Christ was as follows: After\nHis mother Mary was Betrothed to Joseph, before they came\ntogether, she was found with child of the Holy Spirit. Matt 1:1\n\nO- Jesus wasn't filled with the HS at baptism. He was OF the\nHoly Spirit from birth. John was filled w/ spirit from birth.\nJesus was of the Holy Spirit but BORN of a virgin. No insemis\nJesus was fully man but fully God born of a virgin.\n\nA- Jesus was of the Holy Spirit and anointed → tested → released\ninto His ministry at 30yrs old. I feel I've been anointed and\ntested but not released into the full call of God on my\nlife.\n\nP- God please guide and direct me into making disciples\nfor you.\n\nJune 28\nS- Therefore by the deeds",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1782891525789.jpg",
