          "import_batch_id": null,
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2026-06-29",
          "ocr_text": "for you.\n\nJune 28\nS- Therefore by the deeds of the law no flesh will be justified\n   in His sight for by the law is the knowledge of sin. Rom 3:20\n\nO- The law just shows me what I am unable to do. But grace\n   empowers me to live in victory over sin. Sin crouches at the door\n   I must rule over it.\n\nA- How do I rule over sin? Through a meaningful sacrifice.\n   Able offered a sacrifice pleasing to God. I was accepted\n   and Abel was deemed righteous. If my sacrifice is\n   acceptable, I will rule over sin.\n\nP- God help me to serve you with my time, talent, treasure.\n   I don't want to give you leftovers but the best of\n   my heart.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1782892015375.jpg",
