          "import_batch_id": null,
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2026-06-30",
          "ocr_text": "Able offered a sacrifice over sin? Through a meaningful secret and Abel was deemed pleasing to God. I was accepted. acceptable, I will rule over sin.\n\nP- God help me to serve you w/ my time, talent, treasure. I don't want to give you leftovers but the best of my heart.\n\nJune 30 - Gen 2, Pt 2, Pt 2, Matt 7, Rom 4\nS- Then God blessed the seventh day and sanctified it (set apart, make pure) because in it he vested from all his work which God created and made. Gen 2:3\n\nO- It is in vest that we find sanctification not in our work\n\nA- There is a rest for the people of God. Not in, sin but sanctification that comes from vest in the finished work.\n\nP- Jesus did the work of redemption that I can vest in the finished work of. Thank you Jesus that you made me acceptable to the Father.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1782893117017.jpg",
