        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-02T17:21:28.20398+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "c4fdebff-8dac-4d73-ab7b-66760d363493",
          "import_batch_id": null,
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2026-07-02",
          "ocr_text": "Date 2/8/2023\n\nPhillipians 4:6\n\n① Do not be anxious about anything but in every situation, by prayer and petition, with thanksgiving present your request to God.\n\n② And the peace of God which transcends all understanding, will guard your heart and your minds in Jesus Christ.\n\nJesus tells us not to worry, but Pray and God himself all he will bless us with more than we ask for and he will protect us all our souls. So Put him first,\n\n④ Many times I dont put God first and I seek worldly things before God. Only when things get really bad I ask for Him.\n\nI will put God above all things and Pray in all situations. I will give thanks and Share his Good Works.\n\nDear God,\nForgive me of my sins, I know Im not perfect but with You by my side makes me know that I am loved. I pray that you continue to grow my faith and love for you so that I can be a reflection of how you are.\n\nI pray that my family will know you and Allow me I pray that you shield my kids from the enemy and I pray that they seek you first in all situations.\n\nThank you for all youve done for me.\nI love You with all my heart.\nIn Jesus name Amen.",
          "person_id": "19fc1c36-53df-4e3a-a98e-7a63e9d70ddd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/19fc1c36-53df-4e3a-a98e-7a63e9d70ddd/1783012887295.jpg",
