        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-03T17:52:30.780266+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "bb915be5-13e2-45c9-86a6-49a1bf32aee5",
          "import_batch_id": null,
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2026-07-01",
          "ocr_text": "James 1 4:20\n\nMy dear brothers and sisters, take note of this.\nEveryone should be quick to listen, slow to speak\nand slow to become angry. Because humananger\ndoes not produce the righteousness that God desires\n\nand wants us to humble ourselves and be peaceful\nand listen more than we speak for the Lord our\ngod hates anger so listen quick and slow that\nanger down.\n\nI am truly guilty of this sin and I do need\nto pray more about it. I need to remember anytime\nI get angry that is not of lord and it's just\npleasing to him. So I will pray at listen for\nhis voice when I'm mad at allow god to work\nit out.\n\nDear lord thank you for your love and devotion\nI pray that you guide my heart to allow more\npeace and love rather than anger. I pray\nthat you continue to speak to me so I can live\na better relationship with you. Help be a light\nto others in Jesus name Amen",
          "person_id": "19fc1c36-53df-4e3a-a98e-7a63e9d70ddd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/19fc1c36-53df-4e3a-a98e-7a63e9d70ddd/1783101149537.jpg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/19fc1c36-53df-4e3a-a98e-7a63e9d70ddd/1783101149537.jpg"
          ],
