        },
        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-03T17:53:04.464713+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "3b021d8e-3021-4bf9-ba38-01e5c5844492",
          "import_batch_id": null,
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2026-06-30",
          "ocr_text": "John 12\nJesus is speaking before a crowd and letting them know why he was put on earth and saying he is speaking on behalf of God the Father.\n\nJohn 12:46\nI have come into the world as a light. So there no one who believes in me should stay in darkness. Jesus is telling his people that if you believe in me you will have everlasting life.\nThis reminds me of how much Jesus did for us and how people still turned their backs on him. This is how much our lord feel loves us, and he just wants to honor him and his word and shine his goodness.\nI will try harder to be a light to others be slow to speak and listen for his voice.\n\nDear God thank you for sending your only son and having him die so our sins can be washed away. I pray that you continue to work in my life. Help me be a light to others and bring Peace to those I get in contact with. Help me to have Patience and help me to be a great dad and father to my family. Help my kids to hear Your voice and walk towards the light. In Jesus Name Amen.",
          "person_id": "19fc1c36-53df-4e3a-a98e-7a63e9d70ddd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/19fc1c36-53df-4e3a-a98e-7a63e9d70ddd/1783101184001.jpg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/19fc1c36-53df-4e3a-a98e-7a63e9d70ddd/1783101184001.jpg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": "John 12:46",
