          "visibility": "coach"
        },
        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-03T17:53:41.718586+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "1d09bc30-2f66-4fed-b161-6e7211f55190",
          "import_batch_id": null,
          "import_seq": null,
          "journal_date": "2026-06-29",
          "ocr_text": "Jesus raises Lazarus from his grave about four days after and the Jews believe he is Lord. John 11:40\nThen Jesus said \"Did I not tell you that if you believe; You will see the glory of God.\n\nJesus is telling Martha of her sister to believe in or and have faith. They didn't know Jesus would be able to raise Lazarus from his tomb.\n\nOften times I need to trust in the Lord and believe the he can do anything. So when I get into hard situations hard times when things seem be impossible somethings impossible to accomplish I need to trust in him and pray and listen for his voice and have faith that our God can do anything.\n\nDear God thank you for all what you have done. Thank you for your unconditional love for me. I ask that you speak to me and help me navigate this life that im in. help me to have patience and his life that im in. In Jesus name Amen!",
          "person_id": "19fc1c36-53df-4e3a-a98e-7a63e9d70ddd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/19fc1c36-53df-4e3a-a98e-7a63e9d70ddd/1783101220609.jpg",
